#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.duplicated.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.duplicated"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.drop_duplicates.duplicated:1 of
msgid "Return boolean mask marking duplicate rows."
msgstr "返回标记重复行的布尔掩码。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.drop_duplicates.duplicated of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.drop_duplicates.duplicated:3 of
msgid ""
"Only consider certain columns for identifying duplicates, by default use "
"all columns."
msgstr "仅考虑某些列来识别重复项，默认使用所有列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.drop_duplicates.duplicated:6 of
msgid ""
"- ``first``: mark duplicates as ``True`` except for the first   "
"occurrence. - ``last``: mark duplicates as ``True`` except for the last"
"   occurrence. - ``False``: mark all duplicates as ``True``."
msgstr ""
"- ``first``: 标记重复项为 ``True``，除了第一次出现。 - ``last``: 标记重复"
"项为 ``True``，除了最后一次出现。 - ``False``: 将所有重复项标记为 ``True`"
"`。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.drop_duplicates.duplicated:7 of
msgid "``first``: mark duplicates as ``True`` except for the first occurrence."
msgstr "``first``: 标记重复项为 ``True``，除了第一次出现。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.drop_duplicates.duplicated:9 of
msgid "``last``: mark duplicates as ``True`` except for the last occurrence."
msgstr "``last``: 标记重复项为 ``True``，除了最后一次出现。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.drop_duplicates.duplicated:11 of
msgid "``False``: mark all duplicates as ``True``."
msgstr "``False``: 将所有重复项标记为 ``True``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.drop_duplicates.duplicated:13 of
msgid "Tiling strategy for multi-chunk inputs."
msgstr "多块输入的平铺策略。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.drop_duplicates.duplicated of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.drop_duplicates.duplicated:16 of
msgid "A one-column boolean LiteFrame with the same row count as the input."
msgstr "一个布尔类型的单列 LiteFrame，行数与输入相同。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.drop_duplicates.duplicated of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.drop_duplicates.duplicated:21 of
msgid ":py:obj:`drop_duplicates`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.drop_duplicates.duplicated:22 of
msgid "Return LiteFrame with duplicate rows removed."
msgstr "返回移除重复行的 LiteFrame。"

